    {
      "id": "2121815735127478463",
      "text": "\"A big win for us, especially starting our trip.\" Devon Levi recorded his first career @NHL shutout in a 1-0 victory over the Maple Leafs as the #Oilers extended their win streak to four games. @paigymartin recaps the win from Toronto. @CIBC | #LetsGoOilers https://t.co/AUlFI2BtPw",
