    {
      "id": "2121806952783352038",
      "text": "\"Being a goaltender in the league is a difficult position & getting your confidence & your shutout is all part of that. He's been good for us & we're happy to celebrate that with him.\" Coach Babcock on Devon Levi recording his first shutout. @Enterprise | #LetGoOilers https://t.co/0z26nT4pUw",
      "url": "https://x.com/EdmontonOilers/status/2121806952783352038",
      "published": "2026-11-15T03:26:13+00:00",
