    },
    {
      "id": "2121806890955063592",
      "text": "\"It feels good... Since I was a kid, been thinking about getting a shutout in the @NHL... The guys played unbelievably... Super proud of the guys & that they were able to do that for me.\" Devon Levi shares his thoughts following his first shutout. @Enterprise | #LetGoOilers https://t.co/zYruUCv5AV",
      "url": "https://x.com/EdmontonOilers/status/2121806890955063592",
